          "title": "You'll want to know: بحران",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بحران (bohrân) — \"a crisis\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "کشور در یک بحران بزرگ است. keshvar dar yek bohrân-e bozorg ast. The country is in a big crisis."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural bohrânhâ. Bohrâni — critical."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بحران (bohrân) was borrowed from Arabic buḥrān \"crisis\" (EtymDB); Persian also forms the adjective bohrâni \"critical\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
