          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جلوگیری کردن (jolowgiri kardan) — \"to prevent\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پلیس از تصادف جلوگیری کرد. polis az tasâdof jolowgiri kard. The police prevented an accident."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Takes az: az chizi jolowgiri kardan. Jolow \"front\" + giri \"taking\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جلوگیری کردن (jolowgiri kardan) is native Persian, built from jolow \"front\" + giri \"taking\", from gir-, the present stem of gereftan \"to take\", + kardan. To prevent is to take the front, to block the way."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
