            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پیشگیری بهتر از درمان است. pishgiri behtar az darmân ast. Prevention is better than cure."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Pish \"before\" + giri \"taking\". Pishgiri kardan — to prevent (an illness)."
            }
